...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
build: build_model() { class: ours }
cache: initialize_agent { class: ours }
agent: 금융 에이전트 { class: ours }

user -> ui: Clear cache(C) + 재클릭
ui -> cache: initialize_agent(model_name)
cache -> build: build_model(model_name) — 네 분기 중 하나
build -> cache: xAI/OpenAIChat/Gemini/Claude 객체
cache -> agent: Agent(model, tools, instructions)
cache -> ui: agent (캐시에 저장)
